lessons.bodyEn:
Middleware runs in the order you add it. The usual order is:

- exception handling first, so it catches everything after it;
- HTTPS redirection, static files and routing;
- CORS, then authentication, then authorization;
- the endpoints last.

Put authorization before authentication, and every request is anonymous when it is checked.

